# ==============================================================================
# Custom Crowdin Language Variants (optional)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Copy to docs-custom-languages.conf in the docs project's own
# repository root (not this tool's repository). Most docs projects
# need none of these: unlike phpBB's own language packs, a docs
# project typically picks one honorific register per language up
# front (phpbbdocs-hugo's German content is the formal register only,
# documented as such, and targets Crowdin's plain "de") rather than
# offering both as separate targets.
#
# Only add an entry here if this specific docs project genuinely needs
# a second, independent register of a language as its own Crowdin
# target (mirroring phpbb-crowdin's approach for phpBB extensions).
#
# Format:
#
#   Crowdin ID|Name|Dialect Of|Three Letter Code
# ==============================================================================

# de-x-sie|German (Formal Honorifics)|de|des
